# Vim com o halcyon, airline e NERDTree
Output "/tmp/descartar.gif"
Source docs/tapes/_base.tape
Set Height 760
Source docs/tapes/_inicio.tape
Type "vim ~/.local/share/lvl9/install/50-vim.sh" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 4s
Type ":set nowrap" Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type " f"
Sleep 2s
Screenshot docs/img/vim.png
Escape
Type ":qa!" Enter
